WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Comeback!  Gilford the Lightning

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:29.240
Damn!  It's my turn!

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:34.420
Yugi, since Jonouchi has a monster with 3000 attack points...

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.450
...can't he attack and defeat Marik?

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:41.360
It's true that Marik has no monsters to defend with.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.710
But Marik knows that.

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:49.150
His set card must be a trap.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.400
I have to do something about his trap.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.720
I need Giant Trunade.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.270
C'mon!  Let me draw Giant Trunade!

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.200
I draw!

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:07.460
I have no monster cards in my hand.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:08.720
What should I do?

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.080
His trap card is a problem.

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:16.510
If my attack triggers it, it'll probably go to the graveyard after activation.  But...

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:24.460
But its fiery body melts every turn, dealing you 700 points of damage.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.390
That monster is bit of a nuisance.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.060
700 points every turn?  Give me a break!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:35.310
If I do nothing, I'll lose life points anyway.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:38.280
So I'd rather step into your trap!

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.340
Marik!

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:43.840
As you wish, I'll attack with your grotesque pet!

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:50.280
Really?  I thought you were too scared of my set card to attack.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.240
Quiet you!

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.940
But you have good intuition.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:59.960
As you guessed, my trap isn't a Continuous Trap.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.630
It'll leave the field next turn.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:08.070
Why is Marik revealing that his set card is a trap?

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.000
Dammit!  He's toying with him!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:16.420
If you provoke the scrub, you may not like what he does.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:22.580
Even Kaiba Corporation's computers can't predict his moves.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.040
Here I go!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.660
My pet's attack name is Golem Volcano!

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:30.520
Jonouchi, declare your attack!

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:33.770
I'll choose its attack name!

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.800
Lava Golem attacks!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.190
Jonouchi Fire!

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.580
J-Jonouchi Fire?

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.360
I-It's nice!  Go!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.630
It's cool!  Jonouchi Fire!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.970
My set trap activates.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.820
Relieve Monster!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:57.800
This card activates when you attack.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:03.620
After returning my monster to my hand, I can Special Summon a Level 4 monster.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.070
His own monster?

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:09.240
But Marik has no monsters on his field.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:14.300
Actually, he has Plasma Eel that's hurting Jonouchi's Panther Warrior.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.530
I return Plasma Eel to my hand.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:20.970
I summon Plasma Eel again in defense position!

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.820
Plasma Eel can't be destroyed in battle.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.260
Damn!

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:40.830
And Helpoemer destroys a card in your hand.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.100
I end my turn.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.830
Look.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:58.880
Lava Golem's fiery body melts, taking away your life points.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.810
Hot hot!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.920
You're so lame.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:10.000
Another Shadow Game is taking place.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:20.000
Marik's dark side won't be satisfied until he sends everyone into the darkness?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.970
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.400
Machine Duplication.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.070
I'll use this card to paralyze you.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.170
I activate the spell card, Machine Duplication!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.750
Machine Duplication?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:41.750
When there's a Machine-Type monster with 500 or fewer attack points on the field...

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:47.690
...this spell card Special Summons up to two copies from my deck.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:48.860
What?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:56.230
I have two more Plasma Eels in my deck.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.570
Come out, Plasma Eels!

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.810
What?

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.440
Three Plasma Eels on his field?

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:13.630
Use your effects and bite his monsters!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:24.860
No!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.100
Jonouchi!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.230
Let me hear you scream harder!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:35.900
How many more turns can you survive, Jonouchi?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.580
You scum!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:54.520
I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.300
At this rate, Jonouchi will...

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.080
Damn!  Can't he do something?

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:06.470
I guess he doesn't need to summon a God against a scrub.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.450
Yugi, can't Jonouchi do something?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.710
Jonouchi only has one card in his hand.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:16.640
But it always has potential!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:20.150
Don't give up!  Believe in your hand to the end!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:30.820
As long as Lava Golem is on my field, I'll keep losing life points.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.280
If I don't do something about it, I'll lose.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:39.100
But I only have Graceful Dice in my hand.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.610
Yugi.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.000
Oh yeah.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.280
I promised to meet Yugi in the finals.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.680
I can't lose here!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:55.120
I believe in my deck's top card!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.820
Gilford the Lightning!

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:06.140
To summon a Level 8 monster, I need to tribute monsters on my field.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:11.370
But I can't tribute monsters that have Plasma Eels attached.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.800
Panther Warrior alone isn't enough tribute.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.480
Wait a sec!

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.670
There's another way!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.840
I activate my spell card!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.510
Graceful Dice!

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:27.480
When my monster has 500 or fewer attack points...

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.990
...Graceful Dice multiplies it by the number I roll!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:41.700
Marik, Machine Duplication only works on Machine-Type monsters with 500 or fewer attack points.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.070
I see!  Well done, Jonouchi!

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:51.510
I'll use this to raise your Plasma Eel's attack points!

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.960
Multiply Plasma Eel's attack points by 6!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.690
500 becomes 3000!

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:15.140
So the Continuous Spell Machine Duplication is destroyed!

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:22.300
And the two Plasma Eels attached to my monsters are also destroyed!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.740
Now I have three monsters to tribute!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:27.850
Here I go!

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:32.750
I tribute Lava Golem, Rocket Warrior and Panther Warrior!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.820
I summon Gilford the Lightning!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.540
He will finish you!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.480
Get ready, Marik!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.030
How's that!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.740
He's the strongest servant in my deck!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.430
The legendary warrior who wields lightning!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.970
He'll crush you, Marik!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.280
Awesome!

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:33.130
By summoning a high Level monster, he turned the tables!

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:34.910
Finish him, Jonouchi!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.350
What's so funny?

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.710
You fool.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:46.340
Thanks to you, my Plasma Eel has 3000 attack points.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:51.770
Gilford the Lightning has 2800 attack points, so my monster is stronger!

00:10:55.200 --> 00:11:00.000
You summoned a legendary warrior in vain.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.640
You're the fool, Marik!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.370
What?

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:12.280
Gilford the Lightning can activate his effect by tributing three monsters.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:14.420
Show him, Jonouchi!

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.100
Here goes!

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.750
I activate Gilford the Lightning's effect!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.710
Lightning Thunder!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.400
What?

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:37.600
Plasma Eels can't be destroyed in battle, so why were they destroyed?

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.420
It wasn't a battle.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.770
It was an effect.

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:49.020
When Gilford the Lightning is summoned, he destroys your monsters.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.850
No matter what effects your monsters have.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:57.140
Good!  There are no monsters on your field!

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.930
Get ready, Marik!

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:02.440
Gilford the Lightning attacks you directly!

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.760
Lightning Crush Sword!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:08.300
If this succeeds, I win!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.170
That won't work!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.600
I flip over my trap!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.120
Nightmare Mirror!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:21.870
Jonouchi, congrats for making it this far.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.880
But playtime is over.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.230
What?  I'm in the mirror!

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:37.770
Yes.  And Gilford the Lightning will attack your reflection.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.140
Listen, Jonouchi.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:57.120
By attacking Nightmare Mirror, you lose 1000 life points.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:02.970
But I have to discard one card from my hand.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.550
I'll discard this card.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:13.170
Helpoemer sends one card in your hand to the graveyard-

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.700
Oh wait.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:19.370
You have no cards in your hand.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.650
He's very confident.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.870
He's planning to do something next turn.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.150
Will he finally play it?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.350
I end my turn!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:33.300
He has no monsters or set cards on his field.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.720
If I can survive this turn, I'll win!

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.660
My turn.  I draw.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:47.550
C'mon!  Stop giggling like a maniac and make your move!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.250
I miscalculated badly.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:55.400
I can't believe I have to play my God against someone like you.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.470
God?

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.510
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:04.520
Ra's attack points equal the sum of the three tributed monsters' attack points.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:10.460
How can he summon it without tributing and still have attack points?

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.710
Big brother, he's going to summon his God!

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:22.020
Jonouchi, you'll be sacrificed during these semifinals...

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:24.850
...so that I can learn how to defeat Ra.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:29.910
All of Ra's secret effects will be revealed this turn!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:36.150
I deciphered the God Card's hieratic text.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:42.330
Effect #1: Ra gains the power of three tributes.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:47.040
But God's controller must chant the ancient spell to the heavens.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.980
Effect #2: God shall rise from the earth.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:55.340
Resurrect by offering a servant's life.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:15:01.380
It shall instantly incinerate its enemy on the battlefield.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:08.960
Effect #3: God shall instantly transform into a phoenix.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:12.220
The monsters it chooses shall rest underground.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.200
I activate a spell card!

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.480
Monster Reborn!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.660
Bear witness to God!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.010
Big brother!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.670
He summoned Ra with Monster Reborn?

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.970
But it has 0 attack points.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:57.510
And God is only affected by spells for one turn.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.420
So though he Special Summoned it...

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:02.370
...it'll return to the graveyard without attacking.

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:08.000
Ra has a quick effect.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.540
I activate its third effect.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.750
What's happening?

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:19.000
Ra is surrounded in flames and changing its form!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.620
The Winged Dragon of Ra's final form!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.320
God Phoenix!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.320
God Phoenix?

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.500
It's nothing like when Mai was defeated!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:37.020
I never thought I'd have to show you Ra's true form.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:40.170
Jonouchi, well done.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.200
It's incredible!

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:45.110
This is Ra's final form!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.720
It's over, Jonouchi!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:50.060
You will die this turn!

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:55.300
Why do I feel uneasy?

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:59.630
I feel like something bad will happen to my brother.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.930
Ishizu.

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:12.670
Shouldn't you go?

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:16.240
Your brother is competing.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.620
It's fine.

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:22.460
I'm taking care of Mai.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.720
She's still sleeping.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.370
Umm...

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:38.710
If Marik is defeated, Mai will be healed, right?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:43.260
My brother is currently dueling Marik.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:50.340
So Katsuya Jonouchi is the one fighting in the Shadow Game.

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:54.780
My brother is fighting to save Mai.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:18:01.820
So the most I can do is stay by Mai's side.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.060
I feel the same.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:10.830
Now that I lost the power of the Millennium Necklace...

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:18.700
...I can only pray for Marik's dark side to perish and for Odion to awaken.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.680
But one woman is enough to handle all these tasks.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.520
Ishizu...

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.760
I'll keep my eye on her.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.560
So you can go.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.320
But...

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.340
I know you're worried about your brother.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.160
Go on.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.600
Please take care of Mai!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:59.410
A Shadow Game is a game of death.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:07.040
What will happen to your brother may be worse than you imagine.

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:11.720
Brother!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:21.080
But as siblings, you must accept everything about each other and fight together.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:27.800
Because you're each other's only family.

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:38.960
Since he used Monster Reborn to Special Summon Ra, it has 0 attack points.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:43.120
But Marik claimed he'd defeat Jonouchi this turn.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:48.400
Does that mean Ra has an even more terrifying effect?

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.630
Yugi!

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.060
Kaiba!

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:57.400
It's all thanks to Jonouchi that you can witness Ra's final form.

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.760
You should send him off with a round of applause.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.940
This poor duelist will fall into hell!

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:09.640
Hey, punk!  Stop acting like you've already won!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:15.780
I still have Gilford the Lightning with 2800 attack points!

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:19.620
Let's see you destroy it using a God with 0 attack points!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.860
Just be quiet and wait for death, Jonouchi.

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:34.780
God's secret effect will send you to hell in the most excruciating pain.

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:37.260
What?  What effect?

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.910
Ra's third effect.

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:46.250
By paying 1000 life points, it burns your monster into ashes!

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:49.690
No matter how many attack points it has!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:53.700
He's going to destroy Gilford the Lightning?

00:20:54.400 --> 00:21:02.040
But even if you use its effect to destroy my monster, you still can't hurt my life points.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.800
It's impossible to defeat me this turn!

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:06.450
Did you forget?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.340
This duel is a Shadow Game.

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:16.600
Each player feels his monster's pain.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.660
Brother...

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:25.020
God's judgment will burn your emotional strength into ashes.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:30.740
Even if you have life points left, the death of defeat awaits you!

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:32.840
Watch!

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:36.770
The phoenix soars, inviting you into the darkness!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.460
God Phoenix!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:45.680
Stop!

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:50.400
If The Winged Dragon of Ra's effect burns up Gilford the Lightning...

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:54.800
The Shadow Game connects Jonouchi to his monster, so his spirit will burn away!

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:57.200
Please don't die, Jonouchi!

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:01.930
If you lose, what happens to your promise with Mai and Yugi?

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:06.830
You still have life points left.  If you can hang on, you'll defeat Marik!

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:09.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Jonouchi Dies

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:10.930
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:22.750
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:31.690
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.670
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:40.640
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:48.610
